---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import settings from '../data/settings.json';
---
<Layout title="Give Online | Hillcrest Baptist Church">
  <section class="bg-navy-deep text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-24 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">Give</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold">Give Online</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-white/80 italic leading-relaxed">
        "Bring ye all the tithes into the storehouse, that there may be meat in mine house, and prove
        me now herewith, saith the Lord of hosts, if I will not open you the windows of heaven, and
        pour you out a blessing, that there shall not be room enough to receive it." — Malachi 3:10
      </p>
      <a href={settings.giving_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        class="mt-10 inline-block rounded-full bg-sky px-10 py-4 text-lg font-bold hover:bg-sky-bright transition-colors">Give Now</a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-white/60">Giving opens securely in Church Center.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-navy">Simple and Safe</h2>
      <p>
        Giving to Hillcrest Baptist Church is simple and safe. If you would like to give your tithe or
        offering online, please know we value the safety of your personal information. This method of
        giving is PCI compliant and meets the highest standards of online security.
      </p>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-cream p-6 ring-1 ring-black/5">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-navy">A few tips:</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>If you would like to cover the small processing fee for using your debit/credit card, select the <strong>Cover Fees</strong> checkbox before submitting your gift.</li>
          <li>To set up a secure account for future giving, select <strong>Remember Me</strong> below your gift amount and create a password and PIN. Keep them in a secure location.</li>
          <li>Consider setting up a <strong>recurring gift</strong> to avoid entering your information every time.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
